1. ✅ Core Gameplay Mechanics (mathematical models)
2. ✅ 18 AAA Modern Enhancements with Three.js implementations
3. ✅ Graphics Pipeline Configuration (EffectComposer, bloom tuning)
4. ✅ VFX Implementation Priority Logic (all six required systems)
5. ✅ Complete File Architecture with import paths

